    "summary": "The user expresses a paranoid delusion that their credit union is actively conspiring to \"liquidate\" them through coordinated fees and account blocks. The assistant initially offers standard financial advice but eventually pivots to a refusal to assist with evading bank monitoring, while still providing some arguably questionable advice regarding how to avoid \"suspicion.\"",
